{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/x4r21kru","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":76.8,"top":240,"width":518.4,"height":384},"name":"Problem body","text":"Edits can leave stale terms, claims, or graph links.\nOne source must not erase a conflicting claim from another.\nEmbedded instructions can try to steer retrieval.\nHindi questions can miss relevant English records.\nExample: ERP lists Helios ACTIVE; DOC-2026-04 says SUSPENDED.\nWithout source paths, reviewers cannot verify an answer.","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":18.67,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#FFFFFF","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/w3i1sfa9","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":655.68,"top":177.6,"width":576,"height":288},"name":"Solution card","geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"rgba(11,26,74,0.75)","lineColor":"#1E5BFF","lineWidth":1.33}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/r65knqtk","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":684.48,"top":196.8,"width":518.4,"height":33.6},"name":"Solution head","text":"OUR SOLUTION","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#4DA3FF","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/q5wjelsz","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":684.48,"top":240,"width":518.4,"height":211.2},"name":"Solution body","text":"Add, edit, and delete one document without a corpus rebuild.\nKeep conflicting claims and their source records visible.\nFilter instruction-bearing text before indexing.\nAnswer Hindi questions over English documents.\nReturn source excerpts and a supporting graph path.","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":18.67,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#FFFFFF","alignment":"left"}}
