{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/943mhgre","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":684.48,"top":484.8,"width":518.4,"height":144},"name":"Unique body","text":"Read-only SQL uses SQLite read-only mode and an authorizer.\nValidation distinguishes support, conflict, clarification, and insufficient evidence.\nEntity alias merges can be reversed.\nEvidence replay shows where each answer came from.","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":18.67,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#FFFFFF","alignment":"left"}}
