{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/m5kbi1oj","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":477.12,"top":249.6,"width":326.4,"height":364.8},"name":"Economic Feasibility body","text":"Current stage: working local prototype.\nThe deterministic test path uses no paid API key.\nLikely cost drivers: hosting, source connectors, and support.\nHosting and integration costs have not been measured.\nPilot pricing and return on investment remain unvalidated.","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":18.67,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#FFFFFF","alignment":"left"}}
